# Everything listed here is kept OUT of the Docker build.
# See docs/adr/0013-api-container-image.md.
#
# The most important rule: secrets must never get into an image layer.
# A secret baked into an image stays there even if a later step deletes it.

# NOTE: unlike .gitignore, a pattern here matches only at the TOP of the build
# folder unless it starts with **/ (which means "at any depth").

# Secrets and local settings (at any depth)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Local environments and caches (rebuilt inside the image)
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pyright
**/.mypy_cache

# Not needed at run time
tests
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
